.TH ${DISPLAY_NAME} 1 "${MANPAGE_DATE}" ${PKG_NAME} "Linux User's Manual"
.SH NAME
${PKG_NAME} \- ${DISPLAY_NAME} web browser
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ${PKG_NAME}
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIURL\fR]

.B /usr/lib/${PKG_NAME}/${PKG_NAME}
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIURL\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fB${DISPLAY_NAME}\fR is an open-source web browser focused on performance,
privacy, standards support, and user choice.
.SH USAGE
If ${DISPLAY_NAME} is already running, \fB${PKG_NAME}\fR asks it to open a new
browser window. Otherwise it starts a new browser instance.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS "Browser options"
.TP
.B \-h, \-help
Show a summary of options.
.TP
.B \-v, \-version
Print ${DISPLAY_NAME} version.
.TP
\fB\-P\fR [\fIprofile\fR]
Start with \fIprofile\fR. When no profile is given, show the Profile Manager.
.TP
.B \-ProfileManager
Start with the Profile Manager.
.TP
.B \-no\-remote
Do not connect to a running ${DISPLAY_NAME} instance.
.TP
\fB\-new\-window\fR \fIURL\fR
Open \fIURL\fR in a new window.
.TP
\fB\-new\-tab\fR \fIURL\fR
Open \fIURL\fR in a new tab.
.TP
.B \-private\-window
Open a new private browsing window.
.TP
.B \-safe\-mode
Start ${DISPLAY_NAME} in Troubleshoot Mode.
.TP
.B \-headless
Run without a visible UI.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI/usr/bin/${PKG_NAME}\fR
Symbolic link to \fB/usr/lib/${PKG_NAME}/${PKG_NAME}\fR.
.TP
\fI/usr/lib/${PKG_NAME}/${PKG_NAME}\fR
${DISPLAY_NAME} executable.
.TP
\fI/usr/lib/${PKG_NAME}/${PKG_NAME}\-bin\fR
Legacy executable.
.SH BUGS
Report issues at \fIhttps://github.com/BrowserWorks/Waterfox/issues\fR.
.SH AUTHORS
.TP
.B BrowserWorks
.I https://www.waterfox.com/
